VeridianOS: kscreen-console: report files it cannot open

GCC reported -Wunused-result for QFile::open() twice in
Console::printSerializations() (console/console.cpp).

When a file could not be opened, the tool went on with an empty read: on
Wayland it printed an empty kwinoutputconfig.json, and on X11 each
unreadable file in the kscreen directory was reported as "can't parse
file" with a JSON error about empty input, hiding the actual cause. A
failed open is now reported with the file error, in the style of the
existing messages; on X11 the loop moves on to the next file. Readable
files are printed as before.

